g reservation (6 guests, Aug 29, 8 PM, The Golden Fork). Discount shown: 15% off. Coupon is removable and is recorded in the reservation shown as \\\"Coupon applied: GROUP15\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Date picker for reservations shows dates 1-26 August as disabled (past/today), while dates 27+ are clickable (future). All selected times work: tested times 11:30, 12:00, 12:30, 17:30-21:00 were available.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Modified upcoming reservation: changed time from 20:00 to 19:00 and party size from 6 to 4 guests using modification dialog. Changes saved and immediately reflected in reservation list (date remains Aug 29, 2026, coupon still applied).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Review eligibility not enforced. App allows submitting reviews for restaurants with only upcoming (future) reservations, but should require completed (past) reservations.\", \"actual\": \"Successfully submitted review for The Golden Fork while reservation was in \\\"Upcoming\\\" status (Aug 29, 2026). Reservation shows as future date, not past. Review was accepted and displayed despite not meeting \\\"completed reservation\\\" requirement.\", \"evidence\": \"Submitted review (Alex Test, 4-star, Jan 10 2024 visit date) while reservation for Aug 29 2026 was still upcoming. Review appeared in list immediately, suggesting no completed-reservation check.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Applied GROUP15 coupon with 6 guests (which requires 6+ guests per coupon hint). Coupon was accepted and recorded. When coupon applied, Apply button replaced with Remove button, preventing multiple coupons. Coupon remained in reservation even after modifying party size to 4.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"ac